# Feral Deathgorger: "When this creature enters, exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard" (CR 608.2b). Bot1 Bolted
# Bot2 on turn 1 and Bot2 Bolted Bot1 on turn 2, so each graveyard holds a Bolt; a Black Lotus paying for the Deathgorger on
# turn 3 lands in Bot1's, which then holds two. The first card taken is Bot1's Bolt, so Bot2's Bolt cannot be the second
# (the refusal beside the allowed Lotus), and Bot2's graveyard keeps it. The Deathgorger is a 3/5 flier with deathtouch.

